        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: പരിഹസിക്കുക",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പരിഹസിക്കുക — parihasikkuka — \"to mock; to ridicule\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "അവന്റെ ഉച്ചാരണത്തെ കൂട്ടുകാർ പരിഹസിച്ചു. avanṟe uccāraṇatte kūṭṭukār parihasiccu. His friends mocked his accent."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past: പരിഹസിച്ചു, parihasiccu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Harsher than കളിയാക്കുക; the noun is പരിഹാസം, ridicule."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പരിഹസിക്കുക (parihasikkuka) is built from Sanskrit parihāsa, \"jesting, ridicule\" (CDIAL 7902), from the root has, \"to laugh\", with the Malayalam verb ending -ിക്കുക."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
