          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വീമ്പിളക്കുക — vīmpiḷakkuka — \"to boast; to brag\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "അവൻ തന്റെ പുതിയ കാറിനെക്കുറിച്ച് വീമ്പിളക്കി. avan tanṟe putiya kāṟinekkuṟiccŭ vīmpiḷakki. He boasted about his new car."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past: വീമ്പിളക്കി, vīmpiḷakki."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വീമ്പ് a boast + ഇളക്കുക to stir: to stir up one's own praise."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വീമ്പിളക്കുക (vīmpiḷakkuka) is a Malayalam compound built from വീമ്പ്, \"a boast\", whose origin is not settled (DEDR 5448 lists it, with a query, beside വീങ്ങുക, \"to swell\"), and ഇളക്കുക, \"to stir, to shake\", which is native (DEDR 509)."
            }
          ]
        },
