          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ശല്യപ്പെടുത്തുക (śalyappeṭuttuka) is built on ശല്യം, from Sanskrit śalya, \"a dart, anything lodged in the body\" (CDIAL 12352), with the native helper -പ്പെടുത്തുക: a nuisance is a thorn in one's side."
            }
          ]
